WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.400
- [Carlton] Dad?

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.300
- [Dad] Yes, Carlton?

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.620
- [Carlton] There's something I gotta know.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.340
And I don't want you to spare my feelings.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:11.490
I can handle the truth.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.580
- [Dad] Okay son, you have my word.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:15.580
What's on your mind?

00:00:16.728 --> 00:00:18.530
- [Carlton]  When I grow up,

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.580
will I be able to grow a beard like that?

00:00:22.524 --> 00:00:24.190
- You're a Lassiter.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.880
And Lassiter men have been
growing legendary facewigs

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.430
for generations.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.000
It's a king's beard, borne in your blood,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.670
perfected through centuries.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.900
But never forget, it's not
the beard that makes the king.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.449
- I know, I know.

00:00:37.449 --> 00:00:38.490
It's the queen.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:39.490
- That's right, son.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:41.760
We're almost there.

00:00:46.535 --> 00:00:49.140
(ominous music)

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:49.973
- Dad?

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.243
Dad?

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:55.410
Dad, where are you?

00:00:58.339 --> 00:01:01.807
(heartbeat beats)

00:01:01.807 --> 00:01:04.048
Don't look at me!

00:01:04.048 --> 00:01:04.881
Dad!

00:01:06.917 --> 00:01:09.834
- [Chief Lassiter] This is
Chief Lassiter, shots fired.

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:10.913
I'm down.

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:14.250
I've been ambushed and shot.

00:01:15.596 --> 00:01:16.783
Multiple times.

00:01:16.783 --> 00:01:19.380
I need backup, immediately.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.462
(intense music)

00:01:22.462 --> 00:01:24.629
(gasping)

00:01:25.692 --> 00:01:26.525
- Hold it.

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:30.430
Please, I have a family.

00:01:31.678 --> 00:01:33.678
(click)

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.783
- [Dad] Carlton, do you
remember why you're here?

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.397
Think, son, think.

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:47.794
(dramatic music)

00:01:47.794 --> 00:01:50.127
(gun bangs)

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:53.636
(air whooshing)

00:01:53.636 --> 00:01:55.154
(ambulance sirening)

00:01:55.154 --> 00:01:56.709
- [Dispatcher] We have an
officer down, all units respond,

00:01:56.709 --> 00:01:59.570
2016 Parkinson Road, situation critical,

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:02.184
suspect still at large,
approach with extreme caution.

00:02:02.184 --> 00:02:03.804
(rock music)

00:02:03.804 --> 00:02:04.752
- [Both] Surprise!

00:02:04.752 --> 00:02:06.720
- (yelling loudly)
- Surprise, surprise!

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:07.937
- What is wrong with you two?

00:02:07.937 --> 00:02:09.113
- Check it out.

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:11.640
- [Carlton] What is that?

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.706
- That is gift for you.

00:02:13.706 --> 00:02:15.520
(dog whines)

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:17.530
- Meet Morrissey, the rescue dog,

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.860
here to rescue you from
your own handsomeness.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:20.880
- That dog's Chief Hicks'.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.713
- He was.

00:02:21.713 --> 00:02:22.800
- He kept biting our daughter.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.420
- Perfection gnawing is
what the vet called it.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.510
- He called it rabies, Shawn.

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:27.150
- Either way, the Chief, Gus, and I,

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.280
have come to a little agreement.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.399
- She set him loose in my
office and sped away in her car.

00:02:30.399 --> 00:02:31.232
(dog landing)

00:02:31.232 --> 00:02:32.065
Then you called us to come down here,

00:02:32.065 --> 00:02:33.656
and the whole thing just
felt like a win-win.

00:02:33.656 --> 00:02:34.489
(gnawing)

00:02:34.489 --> 00:02:35.538
- That dog is eating my foot.

00:02:35.538 --> 00:02:36.371
- Morrissey!

00:02:36.371 --> 00:02:37.204
- Stop it.
- (hissing)

00:02:37.204 --> 00:02:38.037
- Stop it.
- (hissing)

00:02:38.037 --> 00:02:38.870
- Stop it.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.313
- Oh, excuse me, Carlton, I
didn't realize you had visitors.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.540
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, sorry, no pets.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:49.670
- Pets, I'm sorry, I, (laughing)

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:52.478
that's Morrissey, he's a therapy dog.

00:02:52.478 --> 00:02:54.230
- Does he have a vest?

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.210
- He does, though he prefers
to call it a waistcoat.

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.780
I think you'll find it all checks out.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.980
- Hmm, this is an old Theraflu T-shirt

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:04.083
with tape over the FLU and P-Y in Sharpie.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.671
- You're good, one point for you, Delores.

00:03:08.671 --> 00:03:10.920
(chuckling) My name is Shawn Spencer,

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.760
and this is my partner, Bill Poopingtons.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.340
- No, Shawn?
- What?

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.720
- Sidebar.
- All right.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.150
- Carlton, what is happening right now?

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:18.251
- Let it go.

00:03:18.251 --> 00:03:19.260
- Yes.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.350
- Bill Poopingtons?

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:21.390
What kind of nickname is that?

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:22.670
- Transylvania Dutch, why?

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:24.710
- No Shawn, no more
embarrassing nicknames,

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.510
especially in front of
peers and professionals.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:27.410
- Gus, don't be the night

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:29.095
your dad feel asleep inside your mom.

00:03:29.095 --> 00:03:29.928
- (tsks)

00:03:29.928 --> 00:03:30.761
- We can't just stop doing bits

00:03:30.761 --> 00:03:31.960
we've been doing for 10 years.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.600
We have fans, they have expectations,

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.590
there'll be a huge backlash.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.240
- Shawn, we are two dumbasses,
we do not have fans.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.180
From now on, I do the nicknames.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:42.240
- No no no, absolutely
not, that's disgusting.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.730
Counter-proposal.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:46.760
You have right of refusal
until we land on one you like.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.956
It's a band-aid, but, okay, for now.

00:03:49.956 --> 00:03:52.960
- I'm terribly sorry, Delores,
what I meant to say was,

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.350
my name is Shawn Spencer, this
is my full-fledged partner,

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:57.980
All the Pips in One.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:58.820
- Accepted.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:00.470
Hello!

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.333
- Could you fellas take
a little walk with me?

00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:06.548
- Lassie, is that what I think it is?

00:04:06.548 --> 00:04:08.798
(laughing)

